# Ironworks Ship & Continuity (L6–L∞)

## L6 — /iron:preflight — Deploy Preflight

Verify deployment readiness before shipping. Platform-aware checks.

### Platform Checks

| Platform | Verifications |
|----------|---------------|
| **Vercel** | Framework detection, build output, env vars, function sizes |
| **AWS (ECS/Lambda)** | Dockerfile, task definition, IAM roles, VPC config |
| **Railway** | Nixpacks/Dockerfile, PORT binding, health checks |
| **Fly.io** | fly.toml, Dockerfile, regions, volumes |
| **DigitalOcean** | App spec, components, resources |

### Universal Checks (All Platforms)

- `.env` alignment — all required vars present and documented
- Dependency audit — no known vulnerabilities, lockfile in sync
- Git clean — no uncommitted changes, no untracked files
- Tests pass — full suite green before deploy
- Build succeeds — production build completes without errors

### Variants

- `--platform <name>` — run checks for a specific platform
- `--fix` — auto-fix safe issues (missing env entries, lockfile sync)

